```http
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/hal+json

{
  "id": 42,
  "status": "draft",
  "_links": {
    "self": {"href": "/orders/42"},
    "confirm": {"href": "/orders/42/confirmation"},
    "customer": {"href": "/customers/7"}
  }
}
```

The media type and relation names give the link structure meaning. A client selects the `confirm` relation when available rather than assuming every order has a hard-coded confirmation URI.
